// An order about the runner's bounds, as a typed line (N-101 post 27, H): opened by the owner or a lead (`may open
// order`) and closed at once with the order as its result; like any ticket that closes at once it names who reads it:
// `coord open order --order 'SetBound(runtime, run-seconds, 12)' '@runner'`. The type is agent-base/calls/order.call's.
/// an order about the runner's bounds, closed at once with the order as its result
kind order
  letter O
  form order: Order
  result Order
  pattern
    return order
